# Environment Variable Template
# This is a template file. Copy it to .env and fill in the actual values.
#
# How to copy:
#   - Windows (PowerShell): Copy-Item .env.example .env
#   - Windows (CMD): copy .env.example .env
#   - Linux / macOS: cp .env.example .env
#
# IMPORTANT: DO NOT commit the actual .env file to version control.

# --- Optional ---
# TSL_DATA_DIR: overrides where the local SQLite database and backups live.
# Defaults to a per-user directory (see src/taiwan_stock/infrastructure/db.py);
# the `--data-dir` CLI flag takes priority over this variable when both are set.
# TSL_DATA_DIR=
